  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 3 ranks, Artifice sphere (Field Repair).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use the Field Repair talent as a swift action, without the required tools and without provoking attacks of opportunity, but the object only retains its temporary hit points for 1 round per rank in the Artifice sphere’s associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you can use Field Repair to grant temporary hit points to (and repair) constructs. A specific construct can only have a number of hit points regained this way equal to 4 x the number of ranks in the Artifice sphere’s associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
